e_sha256":"e333e6e30bd8e2a52e1023bb8962e656fc167090c8cbb1f35dd25efa74522faa","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":16},{"dia_id":"D24:17","global_turn_index":418,"locator":"[S24T17]","raw_turn_sha256":"f275f19347af1183a7cc7c0fc39699337e94b4b231c4f4f729fb6fae4d86f8bb","rendered_turn_sha256":"bbf9fa1e3919c02671c74057fde698e3e36adb37bdcfa23dfe100c7242af5f76","session_date":"2023-10-19","session_datetime":"2023-10-19T10:11:00","session_id":"session_24","session_index":24,"source_sha256":"fe840690bd49f7509569355a0c02994530279c0be052391c6f1c1de7a2c030ed","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":17},{"dia_id":"D24:18","global_turn_index":419,"locator":"[S24T18]","raw_turn_sha256":"c0445db69a3a40b4581851fd943c7ead0dab2f5ba4696e81e7dad62ba96ec648","rendered_turn_sha256":"4c572a76196f7ab0f3f43751742fc1fb5a66fb52c14e99e7f379b1cca61defc6","session_date":"2023-10-19","session_datetime":"2023-10-19T10:11:00","session_id":"session_24","session_index":24,"source_sha256":"ebdb48d14dd6ce24df050e5a5773cb1e9278cdc33ad8e30432a3da2fa97637c3","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":18}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s1","store_snapshot_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","text":"Calvin: Wow, the crowd energy is amazing! It always gets me so pumped and it's awesome. Look at that photo, that was awesome!\n[Image caption: a photography of a crowd of people at a concert with their hands in the air]\n[S24T9] (dia_id: D24:9)\n\nDave: Wow, Calvin, that's an awesome pic! Everyone looks so pumped. Where was that taken?\n[S24T10] (dia_id: D24:10)\n\nCalvin: Thanks, Dave! That pic was taken in Tokyo during a concert. Man, the energy was nuts - felt like the whole city came out!\n[S24T11] (dia_id: D24:11)\n\nDave: Wow, Calvin, Tokyo looks incredible! Here's a pic I found online, and it's making me dream about visiting someday. The energy there seems unbeatable! Have you ever visited streets like that?\n[Image caption: a photo of a busy street with people walking and shopping]\n[S24T12] (dia_id: D24:12)\n\nCalvin: Yes, Dave! That was an incredible experience to visit similar streets like you shared in your photo. Is there anything else that interests you in Tokyo?\n[S24T13] (dia_id: D24:13)\n\nDave: Of course, Calvin! Tokyo is amazing! I want to know everything about it - the people, the culture, the food, take a walk at the vibrant city life! In the photo below, the city is so alive and colorful that's impressive! It will be an unforgettable experience!\n[Image caption: a photo of a crowded street at night with people walking and walking]\n[S24T14] (dia_id: D24:14)\n\nCalvin: That photo's a great pic! The lights, the people - so lively! Can't wait to hear your emotions when you see that in person!\n[S24T15] (dia_id: D24:15)\n\nDave: It's really amazing. Hope I'll get to see it in person soon!\n[S24T16] (dia_id: D24:16)\n\nCalvin: Cool, Dave! I'm actually going to Tokyo next month after the tour ends. Sometimes I wish I could go back to places like the one in the photo below. What a great view!\n[Image caption: a photo of a city at night with a tall building in the background]\n[S24T17] (dia_id: D24:17)\n\nDave: Wow, Calvin! That's great to hear! Any specific spots in Tokyo that you're really excited to check out?\n[S24T18] (dia_id: D24:18)","text_sha256":"b91d0aa59092a6921b1fa63bc0a7cec9e7b0208aaf0cef5fc094f6fb2c3b2c5e","timestamp":"2023-10-19T10:11:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"08302ae53c7681312a62f5734d6ef73dfd8c86405ba319838bd79230cce094d2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D3:11"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":44,"line_start":43,"source_locators":["[S3T11]"],"text_sha256":"6ab15929c7a4373390472cc3fdbebc678dc2c15394e48cb325dff731b1f8d75a"},{"dia_ids":["D3:12"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":48,"line_start":46,"source_locators":["[S3T12]"],"text_sha256":"9ab59879ddb4c094ba0f27891506c7dd067c937cf22ee3a1030378b13573caa8"},{"dia_ids":["D3:13"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":52,"line_start":50,"source_locators":["[S3T13]"],"text_sha256":"859ded621a2d1a548